### Area 3: the tracker, an order's timeline, the exceptions queue and the KPIs.
### Every answer is mock data built from the synthetic data and says so in
### meta.mock. Sign in first (see auth.http): REST Client keeps the cookies.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Sign in as Management, who may read all four.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "MANAGEMENT" }

### The tracker, a page at a time. Sort by orderNo, customerName, orderDate or shipmentDate.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracker/orders?page=1&pageSize=10&sort=orderDate&direction=desc

### Only the overdue orders, found by a search.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracker/orders?overdue=true&search=SO

### One order's timeline: pick an order No. from the list above.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracker/orders/SO-0001

### The exceptions queue.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exceptions?page=1&pageSize=25

### Spectra's five measures, as mock lab estimates.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/insights/kpis
